# Beyond Infinity (jeuno 137): Waughroon Shrine (-349.899 104.213 -260.150). A level 91 Warrior at level cap 95, Prelude to Puissance
# completed, the Limit Breaker held, MAX_LEVEL 99, the Soul Gem Clasp held (a GM).
# Available: 10045, option 19: begun and set down at Waughroon Shrine (the clasp held: state 2's finish runs in the same
# lookup, 19 is none of its options).
# Back by a GM warp: state 2's 10045 (91, 1, 5, 1), option 22: set down at Waughroon Shrine again. There, BC_Entrance's 32000
# menu, Beyond Infinity (index 21) in area 1 (the clasp worn), Atori-Tutori killed (won, battlefieldWin 85), 32001:
# the Scroll of Instant Warp, Prog 1. Back at the moogle: 10139 (75, 1): completed, level cap 99.
lists RuludeGardens/Nomad_Moogle/onTrigger RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/10045 WaughroonShrine/BC_Entrance/onTrigger WaughroonShrine/onEventFinish/32001
warning: quests: jeuno.beyond_infinity: one finish of 10045 ran 2 handlers (1/-/onEventFinish:10045, 2/-/onEventFinish:10045) -- the Lua runs it twice too: its sections at LB10_Beyond_Infinity.lua:77 (available), :135 (accepted) and :207 (accepted, Prog 0, no Soul Gem Clasp) at lua-at d8964eb5 hold the finish, and the lookup reads each check after the earlier handlers ran, so the first's status change lets the second match
char zone=RuludeGardens pos=11.5,2.5,121.9 job=WAR lvl=91
levelcap 95
quest Jeuno.PreludeToPuissance completed
keyitem LimitBreaker
keyitem SoulGemClasp
login
trigger Nomad_Moogle                    # available: 10045 (91, 1, 5, 0, 0)
finish option=19                        # begun; set down at Waughroon Shrine; state 2 (the clasp held): no arm
tick 400                                # the zone change runs at the tick
login                                   # in Waughroon Shrine
warp 11.5,2.5,121.9 RuludeGardens       # a GM: back
trigger Nomad_Moogle                    # accepted, Prog 0, the clasp: event 10045 (91, 1, 5, 1)
finish option=22                        # set down at Waughroon Shrine
tick 400
login                                   # in Waughroon Shrine
warp -338.1,104.3,-260.3 WaughroonShrine   # by BC_Entrance
trigger BC_Entrance                     # accepted, the clasp: the 32000 menu
update 32000 option=337                 # Beyond Infinity (Waughroon Shrine), index 21, area 1: registered, entered; the clasp worn
finish                                  # in the arena
kill ATORI_TUTORI                       # area 1's Atori-Tutori: won, battlefieldWin 85, 32001 opens
finish                                  # 32001, battlefieldWin 85 (this arena's): a Scroll of Instant Warp, Prog 1
warp 11.5,2.5,121.9 RuludeGardens
trigger Nomad_Moogle                    # accepted, Prog 1: 10139 (75, 1)
finish                                  # completed: Bushin Aspirant, level cap 99, YOUR_LEVEL_LIMIT_IS_NOW_99
